- **Theory 1** ("Siedem niezmienników Hu") covers η_pq → h₁…h₇, the three layers of invariance (translation/scale/rotation), and h₇'s sign-flip on reflection. Includes one inline Wikimedia Commons image (the Centroid SVG, reused from the predecessor lesson — verified URL).
- **Theory 2** ("Skala log i trzy metryki matchShapes") motivates the `m_i = sign(h_i) · log₁₀|h_i|` transform and lays out the I1/I2/I3 formulas with KaTeX.
- **DataTable** comparing the three metrics (formula, symmetry, behaviour).
