- **Sandbox** seeds a full numpy implementation of `hu_moments(mask)` plus log-transform and four sample masks (square, rotated diamond, scaled square, translated square) so the learner can read off invariance directly.
- **4 lesson-level sources** + section-level sources on both theory sections, all from the curated `## matchShapes i momenty Hu` block in `sources.md` plus one supplementary OpenCV tutorial. No `medium`/`towardsdatascience` URLs.
