`courses/opencv-w-wizji-komputerowej-od-podstaw-do-sar/lessons/optical-flow-rzadki-i-gesty.json` — 5 sections, balanced 0.5 theory/practice mix:
1. **theory** "Stała jasność i problem apertury" — derives the optical flow constraint equation in KaTeX, explains aperture problem, contrasts LK / Horn-Schunck / Farnebäck, with an inline OpenCV docs figure.
